Update the admin assets build: node 21 to node 26.10.0, AdminLTE 3.1 to 3.2, and the webpack loaders, plugins and `datatables.net-plugins` to current releases. `sass` is no longer held below 1.33. The sass deprecations that AdminLTE and its bundled Bootstrap raise are silenced by id in `webpack.config.js`, since nothing in this repository can address them. AdminLTE's postinstall is explicitly approved under npm 12 so its bundled plugins remain available to webpack.
